atisfy their lust!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on your performace, the review left by your customer may be better or worse!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money / reviews to buy new products and expansions for the bar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With enough money and popularity you'll have the chance to make this a nudist establishment. Enjoy the views!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123880/extras/dcb86dff718b4b344c9d124e62e45ac4.poster.avif?t=1748241274\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123880/extras/dcb86dff718b4b344c9d124e62e45ac4.webm?t=1748241274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123880/extras/dcb86dff718b4b344c9d124e62e45ac4.mp4?t=1748241274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123880/extras/93ca70e2b45ef639ee574506d087cdc0.poster.avif?t=1748241274\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123880/extras/93ca70e2b45ef639ee574506d087cdc0.webm?t=1748241274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123880/extras/93ca70e2b45ef639ee574506d087cdc0.mp4?t=1748241274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
